signal&#xa;handler(request)先运行/await再&#xa;检查&#xa;pre-abort试验非默认HTTP信号接&#xa;线&#xa;[ART-AR-EXECUTION]" style="rounded=0;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#eef1f5;strokeColor=#666e7b;strokeWidth=1.733;dashed=0;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#253138;fontFamily=Droid Sans Fallback;fontSize=17.333;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" graphNodeId="call" lane="execution" laneAuthority="analyst-inference" authority="artifact" evidenceSource="ART-AR-EXECUTION"><mxGeometry x="1522.667" y="324.667" width="336" height="190.666" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="node-1" value="AsyncIterable producer.next等&#xa;待&#xa;abort本身不打断pending next&#xa;item到达后检signal →&#xa;ERROR/return&#xa;[ART-AR-EXECUTION]" style="rounded=0;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#eef1f5;strokeColor=#666e7b;strokeWidth=1.733;dashed=0;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#253138;fontFamily=Droid Sans Fallback;fontSize=17.333;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" graphNodeId="producer" lane="execution" laneAuthority="analyst-inference" authority="artifact" evidenceSource="ART-AR-EXECUTION"><mxGeometry x="1522.667" y="640.667" width="336" height="166.666" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="node-2" value="原HTTP loopback socket已close&#xa;解除合成gate后callback仍完成&#xa;并非cloud cancel API观察&#xa;[REA-AR-EXECUTION-REPLAY]" style="rounded=0;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#f1eef5;strokeColor=#80708f;strokeWidth=1.733;dashed=0;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#253138;fontFamily=Droid Sans Fallback;fontSize=17.333;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" graphNodeId="disconnect" lane="client" laneAuthority="analyst-inference" authority="rea" evidenceSource="REA-AR-EXECUTION-REPLAY"><mxGeometry x="58.667" y="324" width="336" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="node-3" value="formatter终局&#xa;nonstream ERROR可投影HTTP200/s&#xa;top&#xa;AG-UI自动tool-end/run-finished&#xa;非全停&#xa;[ART-AR-EXECUTION]" style="rounded=0;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#eef1f5;strokeColor=#666e7b;strokeWidth=1.733;dashed=0;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#253138;fontFamily=Droid Sans Fallback;fontSize=17.333;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" graphNodeId="finish" lane="state" laneAuthority="analyst-inference" authority="artifact" evidenceSource="ART-AR-EXECUTION"><mxGeometry x="2787.998" y="324.667" width="340.003" height="166.666" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="node-4" value="ensure无缓存await&#xa;create→缓存→ready&#xa;并发双create/交错ready返回共享&#xa;实例&#xa;可拿到另一尚未ready对象，仅模&#xa;拟&#xa;[ART-AR-EXECUTION]" style="rounded=0;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#eef1f5;strokeColor=#666e7b;strokeWidth=1.733;dashed=0;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#253138;fontFamily=Droid Sans Fallback;fontSize=17.333;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" graphNodeId="ensure" lane="execution" laneAuthority="analyst-inference" authority="artifact" evidenceSource="ART-AR-EXECUTION"><mxGeometry x="1522.667" y="870.001" width="336" height="190.666" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="node-5" value="runInSandbox callback(sb)&#xa;首次ensure在try外&#xa;只有callback throw进入重建分支&#xa;[ART-AR-EXECUTION]" style="rounded=0;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#eef1f5;strokeColor=#666e7b;strokeWidth=1.733;dashed=0;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#253138;fontFamily=Droid Sans Fallback;fontSize=17.333;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" graphNodeId="operate" lane="execution" laneAuthority="analyst-inference" authority="artifact" evidenceSource="ART-AR-EXECUTION"><mxGeometry x="1522.667" y="1185.373" width="336" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="node-6" value="清当前缓存再新create/ready&#xa;同callback再执行一次&#xa;不先stop旧实例/核对外部效果&#xa;[ART-AR-EXECUTION]" style="rounded=0;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#eef1f5;strokeColor=#666e7b;strokeWidth=1.733;dashed=0;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#253138;fontFamily=Droid Sans Fallback;fontSize=17.333;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1" graphNodeId="recr